    text: "Reset your {{effyProductName}} password\n\n{####}\n\nEnter this code to choose a new {{effyProductName}} password. It can only be used once.\n\nIf you didn't ask to reset your password, you can ignore this email - your password stays the same until a new one is set with this code.\n\n--\n{{effyProductName}}{{#if effyPostalAddress}}\n{{effyPostalAddress}}{{/if}}\nQuestions? Reply to this email or write to {{effySupportEmail}}.\n",
