    text: "Your {{effyProductName}} sign-in code\n\n{{code}}\n\n{{#if isInternal}}Enter this code to sign in to your work account.{{else}}Enter this code to sign in.{{/if}} It expires in {{expiryMinutes}} minutes and can only be used once.\n\nIf you didn't ask to sign in, you can ignore this email - nobody can use the code without it.\n\n--\n{{effyProductName}}{{#if effyPostalAddress}}\n{{effyPostalAddress}}{{/if}}\nQuestions? Reply to this email or write to {{effySupportEmail}}.\n",
