    text: "Your {{effyProductName}} verification code\n\n{####}\n\nEnter this code to continue signing in to {{effyProductName}}. It can only be used once.\n\nIf you didn't try to sign in, you can ignore this email - nobody can use the code without it.\n\n--\n{{effyProductName}}{{#if effyPostalAddress}}\n{{effyPostalAddress}}{{/if}}\nQuestions? Reply to this email or write to {{effySupportEmail}}.\n",
